//! Unicode text the compiler emits for the command.
//!
//! GENERATED by `crates/compiler/scripts/gen_math_symbols.py`; do not edit by
//! hand. Where two commands share a character but not a slot (`\vec` cmmi
//! "7E against `\rightarrow` cmsy "21 are different characters; `\int` and
//! `\smallint` are not), the first declaration in `fontmath.ltx` order is
//! listed and the rest are in `SHARED_TEXT`.

